Program Description\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 This TI-84 Plus CE program calculates how far a vehicle\'92s overhang sweeps outward \'97 or \'93kicks out\'94 \'97 laterally when the vehicle turns at a given angle. By inputting the vehicle's rear overhang length, the distance already cleared, and the angle of the turn, the user can determine how much additional space is required to avoid side-swipe or curb contact.\
This tool is useful for any situation involving vehicles with rear overhangs, such as transit buses, trucks, trailers, or large passenger vehicles.\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

